  "overview": "Scania Digital Design System — Crisp light (#fff) canvas, traton type text typography, #16417f brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fff) canvas paired with `#fff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#16417f` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `traton type text` across 65 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
}
